<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drone strikes have intensified, hitting markets in Darfur, killing over 100 people, and targeting power stations such as Um Dabaker and another facility, cutting electricity to two states. The Sudanese army is accused of launching drone attacks from Ethiopian territory, while Ethiopia denies involvement, and Sudan repeatedly blames Ethiopia for attacks on civilian infrastructure. Women are increasingly serving as frontline responders as the siege worsens. The conflict has also spread nationwide, trapping civilians and prompting mass arrests. The war caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQNUM2QkpNMXJPbmttbnA3MUpGSTNHOEtCMjhyOU1SRHF1S25rME5kR1ZNNzZISDBFd1poZUdGRUZfbkRLXzZMT041aXBnRW1PWk1DRXRzOFJ6d1B5dEFFNklCYWl3ZW9xdENDS3pXZDNNRlhFRXlVU3ZKWm1SSFhKcEQ4ckpMVmhRdENDbXVQQkdzUUtyWU9GUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5xcXhIVUt2MUJIa3hqYjZWOFNJWkxXVk1sR2FNYU5ibGRza2l2eGVKakhJYUNPaExaVzZURVBQVnBxcGkzRkd1SlpvN0pfYjdE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNd3BTazZoY0o0eDloVmFFdkFzY0FfSjRobDJrdm9vRWZWNkdpSnpMVXZnSnY0aTd2ME1FRnNPb180dnVkOWhFNUltTlBOQUtBdFBReGdmYlNPX1kxTGJVVlREQkhodjRlRWpEcXZkT25QU00wOWJjZ0NuMG0wcUVVcC1laDNKZTltckJFR3pPUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kingston Whig-Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNaXpva0M2U2xESEJpZnc4dXFjMFZPc2N1VlRCNjgtVnY0VzYyRjlxaXY0MEtxYlkzODZlYXJIYnBmbGxnTHRnN2hNT3ZnbDN0WENSTUhlNVR4OWs5a3RkU1IyM2Z2WkxLS0pGUEEyc0tPdmxqUTNyUlFSNnJGZXJvQXh